  "uuid": "d9c5edda-8699-4bac-a0a5-99742baf89e3",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "b840cfe8-6bcc-8d6d-6790-9113ea3461db",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "154ce5d3-df50-30da-c5d6-ba5f1c920566",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "This intensive training initiative was designed to empower educators with the essential life-saving skills necessary to respond swiftly and effectively in times of crisis. Participants immersed themselves in a curriculum that not only bolstered their confidence but also enhanced their capability to ensure the safety and well-being of their students and school communities.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "We extend our heartfelt congratulations to all the participants for their commitment and enthusiasm throughout the programme. Their dedication to becoming first responders is a testament to their profound sense of responsibility and the collective vision of building a safer and more prepared community.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "As we celebrate the accomplishments of these passionate educators, we recognize that their newfound skills will undoubtedly make a significant difference when it matters most. This training not only equips them with the tools to save lives but also reinforces the invaluable role educators play in shaping a more resilient and secure future for our communities.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
